  "community-ceiling-fan-wipe": Object.freeze({"sourcePromptAvailable":true,"sourceAuditStatus":"verified-2026-11-05","sourceTitle":"Ceiling Fan Wipe","sourceMediaId":"16504f2c-d9dc-4e31-bfd2-a1b15c8bf2c8","prompt":"Create a 15-second photorealistic fashion transition video, vertical 9:16, featuring Kova wearing FOUR different outfits. Use the uploaded outfit references in order.\n\nIDENTITY:\nPreserve Kova's exact facial features (left eye is brown, right eye is blue when you are looking at a picture of her), complexion, body proportions, and short lavender buzz cut hairstyle throughout. Only her clothes, shoes, and outfit-specific accessories change.\n\nCAMERA AND COMPOSITION:\nOne continuous-looking shot from a fixed high angle near the ceiling, looking diagonally down into a stylish living room. A large ceiling fan sits very close to the camera in the upper foreground. Its broad blades pass BETWEEN the camera and Kova, creating natural visual wipes.\n\nKeep Kova's entire body and the walking pad visible below. No camera movement, zooms, angle changes, or cutaways.\n\nSETTING:\nA modern luxury living room penthouse suite at night with a purple plush sofa on the left, a black accent chair, a rounded glass coffee table, a lavender plush rug on a white and purple marble floor, large abstract African wall art, and a sculptural moder metal console on the right. Soft nighttime cityscape lights create a luxury penthouse feel across the room. A slim walking pad is centered on the rug beneath Kova.\n\nACTION:\nKova walks slowly and confidently on the walking pad, remaining centered in the same position within the room. Her steps are relaxed and natural, with subtle arm movement and realistic hair motion. She occasionally looks up toward the camera with a confident expression.\n\nFAN TRANSITION:\nThe purple metal ceiling fan rotates smoothly in one consistent direction. Time three foreground blade passes to conceal the outfit changes. Each transition happens ONLY while a broad blade fully obscures Kova from the camera’s view.\n\nThe blade acts as a physical wipe: the new outfit is revealed behind its trailing edge. Never show clothing morphing, dissolving, changing color, or appearing on uncovered parts of her body. Match her pose and walking stride precisely across each concealed cut.\n\nTIMELINE:\n0.0–3.5 seconds:\nKova walks in OUTFIT 1, matching the first clothing reference. Establish the full look clearly.\n\n3.5–4.0 seconds:\nA broad fan blade crosses the foreground and fully covers her silhouette. Conceal the first wardrobe cut under the blade.\n\n4.0–7.0 seconds:\nReveal OUTFIT 2, matching the second reference. Continue the exact same walking motion without a jump in position.\n\n7.0–7.5 seconds:\nThe next timed blade pass fully obscures her. Conceal the second wardrobe cut.\n\n7.5–10.5 seconds:\nReveal OUTFIT 3, matching the third reference. Preserve her identity, scale, posture, and continuous stride.\n\n10.5–11.0 seconds:\nAnother broad blade passes across her entire silhouette. Conceal the final wardrobe cut.\n\n11.0–15.0 seconds:\nReveal OUTFIT 4, matching the fourth reference. Let the final outfit remain clearly visible as she continues walking and gives the camera a small, confident smile.\n\nVISUAL QUALITY:\nRealistic fabric movement, accurate footwear, natural anatomy, stable room geometry, and consistent sunlight. Slight motion blur on the nearby fan blades; keep Kova and her outfits sharp. Position the blades so they can conceal her without blocking most of the video.\n\nAUDIO:\nAn upbeat fashion instrumental with the three wardrobe reveals aligned to musical accents. Subtle walking-pad ambience. No dialogue.\n\nAVOID:\nExtra outfit changes, visible jump cuts, body morphing, face changes, floating accessories, sliding feet, distorted hands, flickering furniture, fan direction changes, camera shake, split screens, captions, watermarks, and social-media interface graphics, text on screen, logos."}),
